I read the actual file (sha256 6d21ef23…3750f), previewed, then applied a minimal exact-text patch changing only begin="indefinite" → begin="0s" on the horse-gallop and rider-bob animateTransform elements. All geometry, durations, values, keyTimes, targets, and ids were left untouched.

After the write (new sha256 5b783ec8…a825bc), wukong.verify reported passed=true: no errors/warnings, artwork intact (wukong 272×300/27 shapes; white-dragon-horse 530.36×295/17 shapes), and both wukong and white-dragon-horse now report moving:true. The onload beginElement() fallback was not needed."}
